jfes:DenominatorProperty a sh:PropertyShape ; sh:path jfe:denominator ; sh:maxCount 1 ; sh:datatype xsd:nonNegativeInteger .
jfes:IntervalLowerProperty a sh:PropertyShape ; sh:path jfe:intervalLower ; sh:maxCount 1 ; sh:datatype xsd:decimal .
jfes:IntervalUpperProperty a sh:PropertyShape ; sh:path jfe:intervalUpper ; sh:maxCount 1 ; sh:datatype xsd:decimal .

jfes:EvaluatorHealthShape
