jfes:MeasuresEvaluatorProperty a sh:PropertyShape ; sh:path jfe:measuresEvaluator ; sh:minCount 1 ; sh:maxCount 1 ; sh:class jfe:Evaluator ; sh:nodeKind sh:IRI .

jfes:AggregateResultShape
