jfes:AdmittedFromRunProperty a sh:PropertyShape ; sh:path jfe:admittedFromRun ; sh:minCount 1 ; sh:maxCount 1 ; sh:class jfe:EvaluationRun ; sh:nodeKind sh:IRI .

jfes:RolloutDecisionShape
