jfes:ToStageProperty a sh:PropertyShape ; sh:path jfe:toStage ; sh:maxCount 1 ; sh:datatype xsd:nonNegativeInteger ; sh:maxInclusive 6 .
jfes:RolloutDispositionProperty a sh:PropertyShape ; sh:path jfe:rolloutDisposition ; sh:minCount 1 ; sh:maxCount 1 ; sh:nodeKind sh:IRI ; sh:in jfes:RolloutDispositionValues01 .

