jfes:ObservedForProfileProperty a sh:PropertyShape ; sh:path jfe:observedForProfile ; sh:minCount 1 ; sh:maxCount 1 ; sh:class jfe:EvaluationProfile ; sh:nodeKind sh:IRI .
jfes:DerivedFromDecisionProperty a sh:PropertyShape ; sh:path jfe:derivedFromDecision ; sh:minCount 1 ; sh:maxCount 1 ; sh:class jfe:RolloutDecision ; sh:nodeKind sh:IRI .
